(FAQ) Tj
T*
(1.What is CCNP Security certification?) Tj
T*
(CCNP Security certification is a professional certification program offered by Cisco) Tj
T*
(Systems, a leading networking and telecommunications technology company. It is designed to) Tj
T*
(validate the knowledge and skills of IT professionals who are responsible for securing Cisco) Tj
T*
(networks.) Tj
T*
(2.What is CCNP Security certification?) Tj
T*
(Yes, Cisco offers online exams for CCNP Security certification. Candidates can take the) Tj
T*
(exams from the comfort of their own homes or offices, provided they have a reliable internet) Tj
T*
(connection, a compatible computer, and a private, distraction-free environment.) Tj
T*
(3. What are the prerequisites for CCNP Security certification?) Tj
T*
(To earn CCNP Security certification, candidates must meet the following prerequisites:) Tj
T*
(1. Valid Cisco CCNA Security certification or any Cisco CCIE certification.) Tj
T*
(2. Knowledge and experience in networking fundamentals, including TCP/IP, routing,) Tj
T*
(switching, and firewall technologies.) Tj
T*
(3. Understanding of VPN technologies, including IPsec, SSL VPN, and DMVPN.) Tj
T*
(4. Knowledge and experience in Cisco ASA firewalls, Cisco IOS firewalls, and Cisco Firepower) Tj
T*
(Next-Generation Firewalls.) Tj
T*
(5. Experience with Cisco Identity Services Engine \(ISE\) and Cisco Stealthwatch for network) Tj
T*
(security monitoring.) Tj
T*
(6. Familiarity with network security concepts, such as secure access control, network) Tj
T*
(segmentation, and threat defense.) Tj
T*
(It is recommended that candidates have at least three to five years of experience in network) Tj
T*
(security before attempting the CCNP Security certification exams. Additionally, candidates) Tj
T*
(should be familiar with industry-standard security protocols and have experience in) Tj
T*
(implementing security solutions in a real-world environment. Cisco provides study materials) Tj
T*
(and training programs to help candidates prepare for the certification exams and gain the) Tj
T*
(necessary knowledge and skills.) Tj
T*
(4. What are the different exams required to earn CCNP Security certification?) Tj
T*
ET
