(To earn CCNP Security certification, you will need to pass the following exams:) Tj
T*
(1. Implementing and Operating Cisco Security Core Technologies \(SCOR 350-701\) - This exam) Tj
T*
(tests your knowledge of implementing and operating core security technologies including) Tj
T*
(network security, cloud security, content security, endpoint protection, secure network) Tj
T*
(access, visibility, and enforcement. 2. Concentration Exam - You must also pass one) Tj
T*
(concentration exam of your choice, based on your area of interest or specialization. The) Tj
T*
(concentration exams available are:) Tj
T*
(? Securing Networks with Cisco Firepower Next-Generation Firewall \(SNCF 300-710\)) Tj
T*
(? Implementing and Configuring Cisco Identity Services Engine \(SISE 300-715\)) Tj
T*
(? Securing Email with Cisco Email Security Appliance \(SESA 300-720\)) Tj
T*
(? Securing the Web with Cisco Web Security Appliance \(SWSA 300-725\)) Tj
T*
(? Implementing Secure Solutions with Virtual Private Networks \(SVPN 300-730\)) Tj
T*
(? Implementing Automation for Cisco Security Solutions \(SAUTO 300-735\)) Tj
T*
(These exams are designed to test and validate your knowledge and skills in implementing,) Tj
T*
(configuring, and troubleshooting Cisco security technologies and solutions. By passing these) Tj
T*
(exams, you demonstrate your expertise in securing networks, devices, applications, and data) Tj
T*
(using Cisco security technologies and solutions.) Tj
T*
(5. What is the format of the CCNP Security certification exams?) Tj
T*
(The format of the CCNP Security certification exams is computer-based and consists of) Tj
T*
(multiple-choice questions, drag-and-drop questions, simulation-based questions, and other) Tj
T*
(types of interactive questions. The exams are typically administered at Pearson VUE testing) Tj
T*
(centres, Net Expert Solutions is also a person VUE Authorised Center, and you can register) Tj
T*
(and schedule your exam through the Pearson VUE website. On the day of the exam, you will be) Tj
T*
(provided with an online tutorial that will help you understand the exam format and) Tj
T*
(functionality, and you will have the opportunity to take a short break between exam) Tj
T*
(sections. The total duration of the exam varies depending on the specific exam, but most) Tj
T*
(exams are approximately 90 minutes to 120 minutes long. The passing score for each exam may) Tj
T*
(also vary, but it is usually around 70-80%. Before taking the exam, it is recommended that) Tj
T*
(you review the exam topics and prepare using resources such as Cisco's official study) Tj
T*
(materials, practice tests, and other study aids to increase your chances of success.) Tj
T*
(6. What topics are covered in the CCNP Security certification exams?) Tj
T*
(The CCNP Security certification exams cover a broad range of security-related topics,) Tj
T*
(including: 1. Implementing and Operating Cisco Security Core Technologies \(SCOR 350-701\):) Tj
T*
(? Security concepts and threats) Tj
T*
(? Network security architecture and components) Tj
T*
(? Secure network infrastructure) Tj
T*
(? Secure endpoint and application protection) Tj
T*
(? Secure network access) Tj
T*
(? VPN and cryptography) Tj
T*
(? Secure cloud and virtualization) Tj
T*
(? Security automation and programmability) Tj
T*
(2. Concentration Exam:) Tj
T*
(The concentration exams cover specific security technologies and solutions, and the exam) Tj
T*
(topics may vary depending on the exam you choose to take. Here are some examples of the exam) Tj
T*
