(7. How long does it take to prepare for CCNP Security certification exams?) Tj
T*
(The amount of time it takes to prepare for the CCNP Security certification exams can vary) Tj
T*
(depending on your level of experience, knowledge, and familiarity with the exam topics.) Tj
T*
