(and the materials you choose to use. Cisco's official study guides for each exam typically) Tj
T*
(cost around $60 to $80 USD each.) Tj
T*
(3. Training courses: If you choose to take training courses or workshops to prepare for the) Tj
T*
(exams, the cost can range from a few hundred to several thousand dollars depending on the) Tj
T*
(provider and the format of the training.) Tj
T*
(4. Retake fees: If you need to retake any exams, you will need to pay the exam fee again for) Tj
T*
(each retake attempt.) Tj
T*
(It's worth noting that some employers may offer reimbursement for exam fees or training) Tj
T*
(costs as part of their employee development programs, so it's worth checking with your) Tj
T*
