T*
(FAQ) Tj
T*
(1. What is the eligibility criteria for CCNP Data Center Certification?) Tj
T*
(To be eligible for CCNP Data Center certification, candidates must meet the following) Tj
T*
(prerequisites: 1. Valid CCNA Data Center certification or any Cisco CCIE certification.) Tj
T*
(2. Pass four exams:) Tj
T*
(? Core Exam: Implementing and Operating Cisco Data Center Core Technologies \(DCCOR 350-601\)) Tj
T*
(? Concentration Exam: Choose one from the following:) Tj
T*
(o Designing Cisco Data Center Infrastructure \(DCID 300-610\)) Tj
T*
(o Troubleshooting Cisco Data Center Infrastructure \(DCIT 300-615\)) Tj
T*
(o Implementing Cisco Application Centric Infrastructure \(DCACI 300-620\)) Tj
T*
(o Implementing Cisco Storage Area Networking \(DCSAN 300-625\)) Tj
T*
(Candidates must pass the core exam and one concentration exam of their choice to earn CCNP) Tj
T*
(Data Center certification.) Tj
T*
(It's important to note that there are no formal prerequisites for taking the exams, but) Tj
T*
(Cisco recommends that candidates have at least three to five years of experience working) Tj
T*
(with data center technologies and solutions. Additionally, candidates should have a solid) Tj
T*
(understanding of Cisco data center technologies, such as virtualization, storage networking,) Tj
T*
(and network security. Be sure to review the latest eligibility requirements and exam) Tj
T*
(policies on the Cisco website before scheduling your CCNP Data Center exams.) Tj
T*
(2. What is the training duration for CCNP Data Center Certification?) Tj
T*
(The training duration for CCNP Data Center certification can vary depending on the) Tj
T*
(individual's experience and learning style. However, Cisco recommends that candidates have) Tj
T*
(at least three to five years of experience working with data center technologies and) Tj
T*
(solutions before pursuing this certification. To prepare for the CCNP Data Center exams,) Tj
T*
(candidates can take instructor-led training courses, online self-paced courses, or a) Tj
T*
(combination of both. Cisco offers a range of training options that cover the exam topics in) Tj
T*
(detail, including:) Tj
T*
(? Implementing and Operating Cisco Data Center Core Technologies \(DCCOR 350-601\) - This is) Tj
T*
(the core exam for CCNP Data Center certification and covers topics such as network design,) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
