T*
(5. Data Center Storage Engineer: As a Data Center Storage Engineer, you will be responsible) Tj
T*
(for designing and implementing data center storage solutions, including storage area) Tj
T*
(networks \(SANs\), network-attached storage \(NAS\), and backup and recovery systems.) Tj
T*
(6. Data Center Virtualization Engineer: As a Data Center Virtualization Engineer, you will) Tj
