T*
(center solutions.) Tj
T*
(5. What is the course curriculum for CCNP Data Center Certification?) Tj
T*
(The CCNP Data Center certification program consists of four exams that cover a wide range of) Tj
T*
(topics related to designing, implementing, and managing data center solutions. The course) Tj
T*
(curriculum includes the following topics: 1. Implementing and Operating Cisco Data Center) Tj
T*
(Core Technologies \(DCCOR\): This exam covers the following topics:) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Network Architecture) Tj
T*
(? Network Design and Topologies) Tj
T*
(? Cisco Data Center Infrastructure) Tj
T*
(? Virtualization and Automation) Tj
T*
(? Unified Computing) Tj
T*
(? Application Centric Infrastructure \(ACI\)) Tj
T*
(? Network Services) Tj
T*
(2. Implementing Cisco Application Centric Infrastructure \(DCACI\): This exam covers the) Tj
T*
(following topics:) Tj
T*
(? ACI Architecture and Design) Tj
T*
(? ACI Packet Forwarding) Tj
T*
(? ACI External Connectivity) Tj
T*
(? ACI Network Policies) Tj
T*
(? ACI Management) Tj
T*
(3. Designing Cisco Data Center Infrastructure \(DCID\): This exam covers the following topics:) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Design Concepts) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Network Design) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Storage Network Design) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Compute Connectivity Design) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Services Design) Tj
T*
(4. Troubleshooting Cisco Data Center Infrastructure \(DCIT\): This exam covers the following) Tj
T*
(topics:) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Network Troubleshooting) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Storage Troubleshooting) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Compute Troubleshooting) Tj
T*
(? Data Center Automation and Orchestration Troubleshooting) Tj
T*
(Overall, the CCNP Data Center certification program covers a wide range of topics related to) Tj
T*
(designing, implementing, and managing data center solutions, including network architecture,) Tj
T*
(virtualization, automation, storage, compute, and application-centric infrastructure. The) Tj
T*
(program is designed to equip IT professionals with the knowledge and skills needed to) Tj
T*
(succeed in a variety of roles in the data center industry.) Tj
T*
