(9. Are there any prerequisites for CCNP Data Center Certification?) Tj
T*
(Yes, there are prerequisites for the CCNP Data Center Certification. Candidates must have a) Tj
T*
(valid Cisco CCNA Data Center certification or any Cisco CCIE certification before taking any) Tj
T*
(CCNP Data Center exams.) Tj
T*
(The CCNA Data Center certification can be obtained by passing the following two exams:) Tj
T*
(? Implementing and Administering Cisco Solutions \(CCNA\) exam \(200-301\)) Tj
T*
(? Implementing and Operating Cisco Data Center Core Technologies \(DCCOR\) exam \(350-601\)) Tj
T*
(Alternatively, candidates can obtain the CCIE certification before taking the CCNP Data) Tj
T*
(Center exams. However, it's important to note that the CCIE certification is a more advanced) Tj
T*
(and rigorous certification than the CCNP, and it requires a higher level of knowledge and) Tj
T*
(experience.) Tj
T*
(Before attempting the CCNP Data Center Certification, candidates should also have a good) Tj
T*
(understanding of networking fundamentals and data center technologies, as well as practical) Tj
T*
(experience in deploying and managing data center technologies.) Tj
T*
(10. What is the exam format for CCNP Data Center Certification?) Tj
T*
(The CCNP Data Center Certification consists of four exams, each with a different format.) Tj
T*
(Here are the details of each exam format: 1. Implementing and Operating Cisco Data Center) Tj
T*
(Core Technologies \(DCCOR\) exam \(350-601\):) Tj
T*
(? The exam consists of 90-110 questions.) Tj
T*
(? The exam duration is 120 minutes \(2 hours\).) Tj
T*
(? The questions are in multiple-choice and simulation format.) Tj
T*
(? The exam measures a candidate's knowledge of data center technologies including network,) Tj
T*
(compute, storage network, automation, and security.) Tj
T*
(2. Implementing Cisco Application Centric Infrastructure \(DCACI\) exam \(300-620\):) Tj
T*
(? The exam consists of 60-70 questions.) Tj
T*
(? The exam duration is 90 minutes \(1.5 hours\).) Tj
T*
(? The questions are in multiple-choice and simulation format.) Tj
T*
(? The exam measures a candidate's knowledge of Cisco Application Centric Infrastructure) Tj
T*
(\(ACI\) architecture, fabric, and protocols.) Tj
T*
(3. Designing Cisco Data Center Infrastructure \(DCID\) exam \(300-610\):) Tj
T*
(? The exam consists of 60-70 questions.) Tj
T*
(? The exam duration is 90 minutes \(1.5 hours\).) Tj
T*
(? The questions are in multiple-choice and simulation format.) Tj
T*
(? The exam measures a candidate's knowledge of data center infrastructure design including) Tj
T*
(network, compute, storage, and security.) Tj
T*
(4. Troubleshooting Cisco Data Center Infrastructure \(DCIT\) exam \(300-615\):) Tj
T*
(? The exam consists of 60-70 questions.) Tj
T*
(? The exam duration is 90 minutes \(1.5 hours\).) Tj
T*
(? The questions are in multiple-choice and simulation format.) Tj
T*
(? The exam measures a candidate's knowledge of troubleshooting data center technologies) Tj
T*
(including network, compute, storage network, automation, and security.) Tj
T*
(It's important to note that the exam format and number of questions are subject to change.) Tj
T*
(Always check the Cisco website for the most up-to-date information on exam formats and) Tj
T*
ET
