(Implementing and Operating Cisco Service Provider Network Core Technologies v1.0 \(350-501\)) Tj
T*
(Exam Description:) Tj
T*
(Implementing and Operating Cisco Service Provider Network Core Technologies v1.0 \(SPCOR) Tj
T*
(350-501\) is a 120-minute exam associated with the CCNP and CCIE Service Provider) Tj
T*
(Certifications. This exam tests a candidate's knowledge of implementing core service) Tj
T*
(provider network technologies including core architecture, services, networking, automation,) Tj
T*
(quality of services, security, and network assurance. The course, Implementing and Operating) Tj
T*
(Cisco Service Provider Network Core Technologies, helps candidates to prepare for this exam.) Tj
T*
(15% 1.0 Architecture) Tj
T*
(1.1 Describe service provider architectures) Tj
T*
(1.2 Describe Cisco network software architecture) Tj
T*
(1.3 Describe service provider virtualization) Tj
T*
(1.4 Describe QoS architecture) Tj
T*
(1.5 Configure and verify control plan security) Tj
T*
(1.6 Describe management plane security) Tj
T*
(1.7 Implement data plane security) Tj
T*
(30% 2.0 Networking) Tj
T*
(2.1 Implement IS-IS \(IPv4 and IPv6\)) Tj
T*
(2.2 Implement OSPF \(v2 and v3\)) Tj
T*
(2.3 Describe BGP path selection algorithm) Tj
T*
(2.4 Implement BGP \(v4 and v6 for IBGP and EBGP\)) Tj
T*
(2.5 Implement routing policy language and route maps \(BGP, OSPF, IS-IS\)) Tj
T*
(2.6 Troubleshoot routing protocols) Tj
T*
