(Individuals can register for the CCIE Data Center certification exam on the Cisco website.) Tj
T*
(Candidates must have a valid Cisco account and pay the exam fee to register.) Tj
T*
(10.What is the passing score for the CCIE Data Center certification exam?) Tj
T*
(The passing score for the CCIE Data Center certification exam is not disclosed by Cisco.) Tj
T*
(However, it is essential to score well in both the written and hands-on lab exams to earn) Tj
T*
(the certification.) Tj
T*
(11.What kind of job opportunities are available for CCIE Data Center certified) Tj
T*
(professionals?) Tj
T*
(CCIE Data Center-certified professionals are in high demand in the industry, and many job) Tj
T*
(opportunities are available. These include network engineer, data center engineer, data) Tj
T*
(center architect, and network manager positions. CCIE Data Center certification opens) Tj
T*
(opportunities for career growth, higher salaries, and better job prospects.) Tj
