(with the CCNP Enterprise Certification. This exam certifies a candidate's knowledge of) Tj
T*
(Cisco?s SD-WAN solution including SD-WAN architecture, controller deployment, edge router) Tj
T*
(deployment, policies, security, quality or service, multicast and management and operations.) Tj
T*
(The course, Implementing Cisco SD-WAN Solutions, helps candidates to prepare for this exam.) Tj
T*
(20% 1.0 Architecture) Tj
T*
(1.1 Describe Cisco SD-WAN Architecture and Components) Tj
T*
(1.2 Describe WAN Edge platform types, capabilities \(vEdges, cEdges\)) Tj
T*
(15% 2.0 Controller Deployment) Tj
T*
(2.1 Describe controller cloud deployment) Tj
T*
(2.2 Describe Controller on-Prem Deployment) Tj
T*
(2.3 Configure and verify certificates and whitelisting) Tj
T*
(2.4 Troubleshoot control-plane connectivity between controllers) Tj
T*
(20% 3.0 Router Deployment) Tj
T*
(3.1 Describe WAN Edge deployment) Tj
T*
(3.2 Configure and verify SD-WAN data plane) Tj
T*
(3.3 Configure and verify OMP) Tj
T*
(3.4 Configure and verify TLOCs) Tj
T*
(3.5 Configure and verify CLI and vManage feature configuration templates) Tj
T*
(20% 4.0 Policies) Tj
T*
(4.1 Configure and verify control policies) Tj
T*
(4.2 Configure and verify data policies) Tj
T*
(4.3 Configure and verify end-to-end segmentation) Tj
T*
(4.4 Configure and verify SD-WAN application-aware routing) Tj
T*
(4.5 Configure and verify direct Internet access) Tj
T*
(15% 5.0 Security and Quality of Service) Tj
T*
(5.1 Configure and verify service insertion) Tj
T*
(5.2 Describe application-aware firewall) Tj
T*
(5.3 Configure and verify QoS treatment on WAN edge routers) Tj
T*
(10% 6.0 Management and Operations) Tj
T*
(6.1 Describe monitoring and reporting from vManage) Tj
T*
(6.2 Configure and verify monitoring and reporting) Tj
T*
(6.3 Describe REST API monitoring) Tj
T*
(6.4 Describe software upgrade from vManage) Tj
T*
(FAQ) Tj
T*
(1. What is Cisco SD WAN Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(Cisco SD-WAN \(Software-Defined Wide Area Networking\) Certification Training is a program) Tj
T*
(that teaches IT professionals how to design, deploy, and troubleshoot Cisco SD-WAN) Tj
T*
(solutions. The training focuses on the Cisco SD-WAN architecture, controller deployment,) Tj
T*
(security, policies, quality of service \(QoS\), and migration from legacy WAN technologies.) Tj
T*
(2.Who is the intended audience for Cisco SD WAN Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(The intended audience for Cisco SD-WAN Certification Training includes network engineers,) Tj
T*
(network administrators, network architects, and IT professionals who are involved in WAN) Tj
T*
(deployments.) Tj
T*
(3.What are the prerequisites for Cisco SD WAN Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(There are no formal prerequisites for Cisco SD-WAN Certification Training. However, Cisco) Tj
T*
(recommends that candidates have a basic understanding of networking technologies and) Tj
T*
(concepts.) Tj
T*
(4.What are the benefits of getting certified in Cisco SD WAN?) Tj
T*
ET
