(1. What is VXLAN-EVPN Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(VXLAN \(Virtual EXtensible LAN\) - EVPN \(Ethernet VPN\) is a type of network technology that is) Tj
T*
(used for data center interconnectivity. VXLAN-EVPN Certification Training is a specialized) Tj
T*
(program that focuses on developing advanced skills and knowledge in this technology.) Tj
T*
(2. What are the eligibility criteria for the VXLAN-EVPN training?) Tj
T*
(There are no specific eligibility criteria for VXLAN-EVPN training. However, it is) Tj
T*
(recommended that learners have a basic understanding of networking concepts and protocols) Tj
T*
(before enrolling in this program.) Tj
T*
(3. What are the benefits of getting VXLAN-EVPN certification?) Tj
T*
(Getting VXLAN-EVPN certification can help learners enhance their skills and knowledge in) Tj
T*
(network virtualization and data center interconnectivity. It can also help them gain) Tj
T*
(recognition in the industry and open job opportunities.) Tj
T*
(4. How long is the VXLAN-EVPN training program and what is the course fee?) Tj
T*
(The duration and course fee of VXLAN-EVPN training programs may Take 40-50 Hours.) Tj
T*
(5. What is the mode of VXLAN-EVPN training - online or offline?) Tj
T*
(Yes, the mode of VXLAN-EVPN training delivered both online and offline.) Tj
T*
(6. What are the prerequisites for the VXLAN-EVPN course?) Tj
T*
(The prerequisites for the VXLAN-EVPN learners are usually expected to have a basic) Tj
T*
(understanding of networking concepts and protocols such as TCP/IP, VLANs, and routing) Tj
T*
(protocols.) Tj
T*
(7. What is the fee structure and are there any discounts available?) Tj
T*
(The fee structure for VXLAN-EVPN training programs may vary depending on the institution) Tj
T*
(offering the program. Some institutions may offer discounts or scholarships to eligible) Tj
T*
(learners.) Tj
T*
(8. What are the job opportunities after completing the VXLAN-EVPN training?) Tj
T*
(Completing VXLAN-EVPN training can open job opportunities in the field of network) Tj
T*
(engineering and design. Job roles that learners can apply for include Network Engineer,) Tj
T*
(Network Designer, Data Center Engineer, and many others.) Tj
T*
(9. How can I Enroll for VXLAN-EVPN Online?) Tj
T*
(You can Enroll for VXLAN-EVPN training Online India by Net Expert Solutions Take a Free Demo) Tj
T*
(and our counsellor guides you about this training and contacting you to inquire about the) Tj
T*
(Enrolments process.) Tj
T*
(10. How do I register for the VXLAN-EVPN certification exam?) Tj
T*
(To register for the VXLAN-EVPN certification exam, you can visit the Net expert Solutions) Tj
T*
(official website \(www.nexpertsolutions.com\) and fill the enquiry form and then follow the) Tj
T*
(registration process outlined on the website.) Tj
T*
