T*
(Exam Description:) Tj
T*
(The Implementing Cisco Secure Access Solutions \(SISAS\) \(300-208\) exam tests whether a) Tj
T*
(network security engineer knows the components and architecture of secure access, by) Tj
T*
(utilizing 802.1X and Cisco TrustSec. This 90-minute exam consists of 65?75 questions and) Tj
T*
(assesses knowledge of Cisco Identity Services Engine \(ISE\) architecture, solution, and) Tj
T*
(components as an overall network threat mitigation and endpoint control solutions. It also) Tj
T*
(includes the fundamental concepts of bring your own device \(BYOD\) using posture and) Tj
T*
(profiling services of ISE. Candidates can prepare for this exam by taking the Implementing) Tj
T*
(Cisco Secure Access Solutions \(SISAS\) course.) Tj
