(Exam Description:) Tj
T*
(DevNet Associate Exam v1.0 \(DEVASC 200-901\) is a 120-minute exam associated with the DevNet) Tj
T*
(Associate - Developer Certification. This exam tests a candidate's knowledge of software) Tj
T*
(development and design including understanding and using APIs, Cisco platforms and) Tj
T*
(development, application development and security, and infrastructure and automation. The) Tj
T*
(course, Developing Applications and Automating Workflows using Cisco Core Platforms, helps) Tj
T*
(candidates to prepare for this exam.) Tj
