T*
(1.5 Explain the benefits of organizing code into methods / functions, classes, and modules) Tj
T*
(1.6 Identify the advantages of common design patterns \(MVC and Observer\)) Tj
T*
(1.7 Explain the advantages of version control) Tj
T*
(1.8 Utilize common version control operations with Git) Tj
T*
(20% 2.0 Understanding and Using APIs) Tj
T*
(2.1 Construct a REST API request to accomplish a task given API documentation) Tj
T*
(2.2 Describe common usage patterns related to webhooks) Tj
T*
(2.3 Identify the constraints when consuming APIs) Tj
T*
(2.4 Explain common HTTP response codes associated with REST APIs) Tj
T*
(2.5 Troubleshoot a problem given the HTTP response code, request and API documentation) Tj
T*
(2.7 Utilize common API authentication mechanisms: basic, custom token, and API keys) Tj
T*
(2.8 Compare common API styles \(REST, RPC, synchronous, and asynchronous\)) Tj
T*
(2.9 Construct a Python script that calls a REST API using the requests library) Tj
T*
(15% 3.0 Cisco Platforms and Development) Tj
