T*
(Developing Applications using Cisco Core Platforms and APIs v1.0 \(350-901\)) Tj
T*
(Exam Description:) Tj
T*
(Developing Applications using Cisco Core Platforms and APIs v1.0 \(DEVCOR 350- 901\) is a) Tj
T*
(120-minute exam associated with the DevNet Professional Certification. This exam tests a) Tj
T*
(candidate's knowledge of software development and design including using APIs, Cisco) Tj
T*
(platforms, application deployment and security, and infrastructure and automation. The) Tj
T*
(course, Developing Applications using Cisco Core Platforms and APIs helps candidates to) Tj
T*
(prepare for this exam.) Tj
T*
(20% 1.0 Software Development and Design) Tj
T*
(1.1 Describe distributed applications related to the concepts of front-end, back-end, and) Tj
T*
(load balancing) Tj
T*
(1.2 Evaluate an application design considering scalability and modularity) Tj
T*
(1.3 Evaluate an application design considering high-availability and resiliency \(including) Tj
T*
(onpremises, hybrid, and cloud\)) Tj
T*
(1.4 Evaluate an application design considering latency and rate limiting) Tj
T*
(1.5 Evaluate an application design and implementation considering maintainability) Tj
T*
(1.6 Evaluate an application design and implementation considering observability) Tj
T*
(1.7 Diagnose problems with an application given logs related to an event) Tj
T*
(1.8 Evaluate choice of database types with respect to application requirements \(such as) Tj
T*
(relational, document, graph, columnar, and Time Series\)) Tj
T*
(1.9 Explain architectural patterns \(monolithic, services oriented, microservices, and event) Tj
T*
(driven\)) Tj
T*
(1.10 Utilize advanced version control operations with Git) Tj
T*
(1.11 Explain the concepts of release packaging and dependency management) Tj
T*
(1.12 Construct a sequence diagram that includes API calls) Tj
T*
(20% 3.0 Cisco Platforms) Tj
T*
(3.1 Construct API requests to implement chatops with Webex Teams API) Tj
T*
(3.2 Construct API requests to create and delete objects using Firepower device management) Tj
T*
(\(FDM\)) Tj
T*
(3.3 Construct API requests using the Meraki platform to accomplish these tasks) Tj
T*
(3.4 Construct API calls to retrieve data from Intersight) Tj
T*
ET
