(wireless health information) Tj
T*
(3.7 Describe the capabilities of AppDynamics when instrumenting an application) Tj
T*
(3.8 Describe steps to build a custom dashboard to present data collected from Cisco APIs) Tj
T*
(20% 4.0 Application Deployment and Security) Tj
T*
(4.1 Diagnose a CI/CD pipeline failure \(such as missing dependency, incompatible versions of) Tj
T*
(components, and failed tests\)) Tj
T*
(4.2 Integrate an application into a prebuilt CD environment leveraging Docker and Kubernetes) Tj
T*
(4.3 Describe the benefits of continuous testing and static code analysis in a CI pipeline) Tj
T*
(4.4 Utilize Docker to containerize an application) Tj
T*
(4.5 Describe the tenets of the "12-factor app") Tj
T*
(4.6 Describe an effective logging strategy for an application) Tj
T*
(4.7 Explain data privacy concerns related to storage and transmission of data) Tj
T*
(4.8 Identify the secret storage approach relevant to a given scenario) Tj
T*
(4.9 Configure application specific SSL certificates) Tj
T*
(4.10 Implement mitigation strategies for OWASP threats \(such as XSS, CSRF, and SQL) Tj
T*
(injection\)) Tj
T*
(4.11 Describe how end-to-end encryption principles apply to APIs) Tj
T*
(20% 5.0 Infrastructure and Automation) Tj
T*
(5.1 Explain considerations of model-driven telemetry \(including data consumption and data) Tj
T*
(storage\)) Tj
T*
(5.2 Utilize RESTCONF to configure a network device including interfaces, static routes, and) Tj
T*
(VLANs \(IOS XE only\)) Tj
T*
(5.3 Construct a workflow to configure network parameters with:) Tj
T*
(5.4 Identify a configuration management solution to achieve technical and business) Tj
T*
(requirements) Tj
T*
(5.5 Describe how to host an application on a network device \(including Catalyst 9000 and) Tj
T*
(Cisco IOx-enabled devices\)) Tj
T*
(FAQ) Tj
T*
(1. What is Devnet Professional Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(Devnet Professional Certification Training is a course designed to provide professionals) Tj
T*
(with the skills and knowledge needed to develop and manage applications built on Cisco) Tj
T*
(platforms. The course covers various topics, including software development and design,) Tj
T*
(automation, and deployment.) Tj
T*
(2. What are the benefits of getting Devnet Professional?) Tj
T*
(Getting Devnet Professional certification can offer numerous benefits, including enhanced) Tj
T*
(job prospects, higher salaries, and better career growth opportunities. It also demonstrates) Tj
T*
(your proficiency in developing and managing applications built on Cisco platforms.) Tj
T*
(3. How long is the Devnet Professional training program?) Tj
T*
(The duration of the Devnet Professional training program may vary depending on the training) Tj
T*
(provider. Typically, it takes around 40-50 Hours to complete the course.) Tj
T*
(4. What is the mode of Devnet Professional training - online or offline?) Tj
T*
(Devnet Professional training is available in both online and offline modes. Depending on) Tj
T*
(your preference, you can choose either mode of training.) Tj
T*
(5. What are the prerequisites for the Devnet Professional course?) Tj
T*
(The Prerequisite of Devnet Professional Course Is Devnet Associate.) Tj
T*
ET
