(Website \(www.nexpertsolutions.com\) as well as NES Physical Center.) Tj
T*
(9. How do I register for the Devnet Professional certification exam?) Tj
T*
(To register for the Devnet Professional certification exam, you need to visit the Cisco) Tj
T*
(website and create an account. Once you have created an account, you can schedule the exam) Tj
T*
(and pay the exam fee. The exam can be taken online or at a testing center.) Tj
