(Cisco Certified DevNet Expert \(v1.0\) Exam Topics ? Lab Exam) Tj
T*
(Exam Description:) Tj
T*
(The Cisco Certified DevNet Expert \(v1.0\) Lab Exam is an 8- hour, hands-on exam that requires) Tj
T*
(a candidate to plan, design, develop, test, deploy, and maintain software solutions within) Tj
T*
(complex automation-driven network environments.) Tj
T*
(20% 1.0 Software Design, Development, and Deployment) Tj
T*
(1.1 Design a solution based on an on-premises, hybrid, or public cloud deployment,) Tj
T*
(considering these factors:) Tj
T*
(1.2 Recommend a deployment strategy to mitigate risk and impact on service availability, for) Tj
T*
(a given scenario) Tj
T*
(1.3 Modify an existing network automation solution based on business and technical) Tj
T*
(requirements \(includes gap analysis\)) Tj
T*
(1.4 Use Git in a CI/CD development workflow) Tj
T*
(1.5 Troubleshoot issues with a CI/CD pipeline \(e.g., code-based failures, pipeline issues,) Tj
T*
(and tool incompatibility\)) Tj
T*
