(Frequently Asked Questions \(FAQ\)) Tj
T*
(1.What is the VMware Certified Associate \(VCA\) certification?) Tj
T*
(The VMware Certified Associate \(VCA\) certification is an entry-level certification that) Tj
T*
(validates your understanding of virtualization concepts and your ability to work with VMware) Tj
T*
(products. It serves as a foundation for further VMware certifications.) Tj
T*
(2.Who should consider pursuing the VCA certification?) Tj
T*
(The VCA certification is suitable for individuals who are new to virtualization or those who) Tj
T*
(want to establish a solid foundation in virtualization technology. It is beneficial for IT) Tj
