T*
(objectives, and practice through mock tests and hands-on exercises.) Tj
T*
(Schedule the exam: Register for the certification exam through an authorized testing center) Tj
T*
(or online platform.) Tj
T*
(Take the exam: Show your knowledge and skills by successfully completing the certification) Tj
T*
(exam.) Tj
T*
(Earn the certification: Upon passing the exam, you will receive the official COMPTIA) Tj
T*
(certification, validating your expertise in the respective domain.) Tj
