(Frequently Asked Questions \(FAQs\) about Cloud Certifications) Tj
T*
(Q: What are the popular cloud certification programs available?) Tj
T*
(A: Net Expert Solutions offers popular cloud certification programs in collaboration with) Tj
T*
(three major cloud vendors: Google Cloud, Microsoft Azure, and Amazon Web Services \(AWS\).) Tj
T*
(These programs include certifications such as Google Cloud Architect \(GCA\) and Google Cloud) Tj
T*
(Professional \(GCP\), Microsoft Azure AZ-104, AWS Associate, and AWS Professional) Tj
T*
(Q: How does cloud certification differ from traditional IT certifications?) Tj
T*
(A: Cloud certifications focus specifically on cloud computing technologies, platforms, and) Tj
T*
(services offered by different vendors. They validate your expertise in utilizing and) Tj
T*
(managing cloud resources effectively. Traditional IT certifications, on the other hand,) Tj
T*
(cover a broader range of IT concepts and technologies.) Tj
T*
(Q: What are the benefits of earning a cloud certification?) Tj
T*
(A: Earning a cloud certification offers several benefits, including:) Tj
T*
(Enhanced Skills: Cloud certifications provide in-depth knowledge and practical skills) Tj
T*
(required to work with specific cloud platforms.) Tj
T*
(Career Advancement: Cloud certifications enhance your marketability and open up career) Tj
T*
(opportunities in cloud architecture, administration, development, and other related roles.) Tj
T*
