T*
(1. What is AWS Associate Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(AWS \(Amazon Web Services\) Associate Certification Training is a program that offers training) Tj
T*
(in the cloud computing services provided by AWS. It includes training in core AWS services) Tj
T*
(such as computing, storage, database, and networking. The training program is designed to) Tj
T*
(help participants gain a fundamental understanding of AWS services and prepare them for the) Tj
T*
(AWS Associate certification exam.) Tj
T*
(2. What are the benefits of getting AWS Associate?) Tj
T*
