T*
(knowledge and skills.) Tj
T*
(2. What are the benefits of getting AWS Professional?) Tj
T*
(Getting an AWS Professional certification can be beneficial for your career in cloud) Tj
T*
(computing. It can help you gain advanced knowledge and skills in AWS services and make you) Tj
T*
(eligible for job roles such as AWS Cloud Architect, AWS DevOps Engineer, and AWS Security) Tj
T*
(Specialist. It can also improve your chances of getting a higher salary and job) Tj
T*
(opportunities in the cloud computing industry.) Tj
T*
(3. How long is the AWS Professional training program?) Tj
T*
(The duration of the AWS Professional training program may vary depending on the training) Tj
T*
(provider. Typically, it takes around 40-50 Hours to complete the course.) Tj
T*
(4. What is the mode of AWS Professional training - online or offline?) Tj
T*
(AWS Professional training programs are available both online and offline. Online training) Tj
