(AWS:) Tj
T*
(Amazon Web Services \(AWS\) is a popular cloud computing platform that is widely used by) Tj
T*
(businesses of all sizes. In this module, you will learn about the AWS platform, including) Tj
T*
(EC2, S3, and RDS.) Tj
T*
(Azure:) Tj
T*
(Microsoft Azure is another popular cloud computing platform that is widely used in the) Tj
T*
(industry. In this module, you will learn about the Azure platform, including Virtual) Tj
T*
(Machines, Storage, and Azure Active Directory.) Tj
T*
(MCSA:) Tj
T*
(The Microsoft Certified Solutions Associate \(MCSA\) certification is an entry-level) Tj
T*
(certification that is designed for IT professionals who want to demonstrate their skills in) Tj
T*
(Windows Server administration. In this module, you will learn about Windows Server 2016,) Tj
T*
(including installation, configuration, and management.) Tj
T*
(Linux:) Tj
T*
(Linux is a popular operating system that is widely used in the industry. In this module, you) Tj
T*
(will learn about the fundamentals of Linux, including the Linux command line, file systems,) Tj
T*
(and networking.) Tj
T*
(Professional Development \(PD\) Classes:) Tj
