(Overview) Tj
T*
(Get hands-on experience with the latest firewall technologies from Cisco, Check Point, and) Tj
T*
(Palo Alto.) Tj
T*
(Welcome to our new course - Multi Vendor Firewall. In this course, we offer 100% job) Tj
T*
(guarantee to our students. Our course covers various types of firewalls from different) Tj
T*
(vendors, including Cisco Firepower, CCSA, CCSE, and Palo Alto.) Tj
T*
(With this course, you will get hands-on training on configuring and managing firewall) Tj
T*
(devices. Our course is designed to provide a comprehensive understanding of firewall) Tj
T*
(technologies and their implementation. The course will be taught by certified experts with) Tj
T*
(years of experience in the industry.) Tj
T*
(Included Courses:) Tj
T*
(Our Multi Vendor Firewall course includes the following courses:) Tj
T*
(Cisco Firepower:) Tj
T*
(Cisco Firepower is a unified next-generation firewall platform that provides advanced threat) Tj
T*
(protection and security analytics. In this course, students will learn how to configure,) Tj
T*
(deploy and manage Cisco Firepower firewall.) Tj
T*
(Check Point Certified Security Administrator \(CCSA\):) Tj
T*
(Check Point CCSA certification is designed for security administrators who want to manage) Tj
T*
(and configure Check Point Security solutions. In this course, students will learn how to) Tj
T*
(configure, deploy and manage Check Point firewalls.) Tj
T*
(Check Point Certified Security Expert \(CCSE\):) Tj
T*
(Check Point CCSE certification is designed for security experts who want to manage and) Tj
T*
(configure advanced Check Point Security solutions. In this course, students will learn how) Tj
T*
(to configure, deploy and manage advanced Check Point firewalls.) Tj
T*
(Palo Alto Networks Firewall:) Tj
T*
(Palo Alto Networks Firewall is a next-generation firewall that provides advanced threat) Tj
T*
(protection and network security. In this course, students will learn how to configure,) Tj
T*
