(Refund Policy) Tj
T*
(Thank you for choosing Net Expert Solutions for your Computer Networking and Cloud Computing) Tj
T*
(related courses. We want to ensure your satisfaction with our services. This Refund Policy) Tj
T*
(outlines the terms and conditions for requesting and processing refunds for our courses.) Tj
T*
(Please read this policy carefully before making a purchase.) Tj
T*
(Eligibility for Refunds:) Tj
T*
(Refunds may be considered for the following reasons:) Tj
T*
(Duplicate payment: If you accidentally made multiple payments for the same course.) Tj
T*
(Technical issues: In the event of significant technical difficulties or platform) Tj
T*
(unavailability that prevent you from accessing the course materials.) Tj
T*
(Dissatisfaction: If you are unsatisfied with the course content or delivery, subject to) Tj
T*
(certain conditions.) Tj
T*
(Refunds are not available for the following reasons:) Tj
T*
(Change of mind: We encourage you to carefully review the course details and make an informed) Tj
T*
(decision before enrolling.) Tj
T*
(Failure to meet course requirements: Refunds will not be granted if you fail to meet the) Tj
T*
(course requirements or complete the course.) Tj
T*
(Refund Request Procedure:) Tj
T*
(To request a refund, you must submit a written request to our customer support team at) Tj
T*
([email protected], providing the following details:) Tj
T*
(Your name and contact information) Tj
T*
(Course name and enrollment date) Tj
T*
(Reason for the refund request) Tj
T*
(Refund requests must be submitted within 7 Days from the course enrollment date.) Tj
T*
(We will review your refund request and respond to you within a reasonable timeframe.) Tj
T*
(Refund Processing:) Tj
T*
(If your refund request is approved, we will process the refund within 45 working days of) Tj
T*
(approval.) Tj
T*
(Refunds will be issued in the same payment method used for the original purchase.) Tj
T*
(Please note that depending on your payment provider, it may take additional time for the) Tj
T*
(refund to reflect in your account.) Tj
T*
(Partial Refunds:) Tj
T*
(In some cases, we may offer partial refunds based on the extent of the course completion and) Tj
T*
