(Overview) Tj
T*
(Reschedule Policy) Tj
T*
(At Net Expert Solutions, we understand that unexpected circumstances may arise, making it) Tj
T*
(necessary for you to reschedule your enrolled course. This Reschedule Policy outlines the) Tj
T*
(terms and conditions for rescheduling your course. Please read this policy carefully before) Tj
T*
(making any reschedule requests.) Tj
T*
(Reschedule Eligibility:) Tj
T*
(You are eligible to request a course reschedule if:) Tj
T*
(You are unable to attend the originally scheduled course due to unforeseen circumstances.) Tj
T*
(You provide a minimum notice period of 10 days prior to the course start date) Tj
T*
(Reschedule Request Procedure:) Tj
T*
(To request a reschedule, you must submit a written request to our customer support team at) Tj
T*
(info@nexpertsolutions.com , providing the following details:) Tj
T*
(Your Name and Contact information) Tj
T*
(Course Name, Registration No. and Enrollment Date) Tj
T*
(Reason for the reschedule request) Tj
T*
(Reschedule requests must be submitted at least 10 Days before the course start date.) Tj
T*
(We will review your reschedule request and respond to you within a reasonable timeframe.) Tj
T*
(Reschedule Options:) Tj
T*
(Upon approval of your reschedule request, we will offer you the following options:) Tj
T*
(Transfer to an upcoming course: You may choose to transfer your enrollment to a future) Tj
T*
(course of the same or equivalent value, subject to availability.) Tj
T*
(Change of course format: If available, you may request to switch from an in-person course to) Tj
T*
(an online/virtual course, or vice versa.) Tj
T*
(Please note that reschedule requests are subject to availability and course scheduling.) Tj
T*
(Reschedule Fee:) Tj
T*
(A reschedule fee of 10% of enrolled total fee the course fee may be applicable for each) Tj
T*
(rescheduled course.) Tj
T*
(The reschedule fee, if applicable, must be paid prior to confirming the new course schedule) Tj
T*
(confirmation on email.) Tj
T*
(Reschedule Limitations:) Tj
T*
(Each enrolled course is eligible for a two-times reschedule only. b. Reschedule requests) Tj
T*
(made within 10 Days of the course start date may not be accepted or may be subject to) Tj
T*
(additional fees.) Tj
T*
(Changes to Reschedule Policy:) Tj
T*
(Net Expert Solutions reserves the right to update or modify this Reschedule Policy at any) Tj
T*
(time without prior notice.) Tj
T*
(Any changes to the Reschedule Policy will be effective immediately upon posting on our) Tj
T*
(website.) Tj
T*
(Contact Us:) Tj
T*
(If you have any questions or need further clarification regarding our Reschedule Policy.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
