(Your AWS Training Journey: Associate vs. Professional Certification) Tj
T*
(Home) Tj
T*
(Blog) Tj
T*
(Your AWS Training Journey: Associate vs. Professional Certification) Tj
T*
(Blog) Tj
T*
(Comments Off) Tj
T*
(on Your AWS Training Journey: Associate vs. Professional Certification) Tj
T*
(Posted By) Tj
T*
(admin) Tj
T*
(Introduction:) Tj
T*
(Amazon Web Services \(AWS\) has become the industry standard for cloud computing, and as a) Tj
T*
(result, there is a growing demand for skilled professionals in the field. AWS offers a) Tj
T*
(comprehensive certification program to validate and showcase individuals? expertise in AWS) Tj
T*
(cloud technologies. Two popular certification levels are AWS Associate and AWS Professional.) Tj
T*
(In this blog post, we will explore the key differences between AWS Associate and AWS) Tj
T*
(Professional training to help you choose the right certification path for your career) Tj
T*
(aspirations.) Tj
T*
(AWS Associate Certification:) Tj
T*
(The AWS Associate certification is the entry-level certification in the AWS certification) Tj
T*
(program. It is designed for individuals who are new to AWS and have some basic understanding) Tj
T*
(of cloud computing concepts. There are three different AWS Associate certifications:) Tj
T*
(AWS Certified Solutions Architect ? Associate \(SAA-C02\):) Tj
T*
(Target Audience:) Tj
T*
(This certification is ideal for individuals who want to become solutions architects and) Tj
T*
(design scalable and cost-effective AWS cloud solutions.) Tj
T*
(Knowledge Requirements:) Tj
T*
(Candidates should have a good understanding of AWS services, architectures, and best) Tj
T*
(practices. They should be able to design and deploy applications on AWS, taking into) Tj
T*
(consideration security, reliability, and performance.) Tj
T*
(AWS Certified Developer ? Associate \(DVA-C01\):) Tj
T*
(Target Audience:) Tj
T*
(This certification is suitable for developers who want to demonstrate their ability to) Tj
T*
(develop and maintain AWS applications.) Tj
T*
(Knowledge Requirements:) Tj
T*
(Candidates should be proficient in writing, deploying, and debugging cloud-based) Tj
T*
(applications using AWS services.) Tj
T*
(AWS Certified SysOps Administrator ? Associate \(SOA-C02\):) Tj
T*
(Target Audience:) Tj
T*
(This certification is intended for system administrators and operations personnel) Tj
T*
(responsible for managing and operating AWS applications.) Tj
T*
(Knowledge Requirements:) Tj
T*
(Candidates should possess a strong understanding of deploying, managing, and operating) Tj
T*
(scalable, highly available, and fault-tolerant systems on AWS.) Tj
T*
(AWS Professional Certification:) Tj
T*
(The AWS Professional certification is the next level of certification after the Associate) Tj
T*
(level. It is intended for individuals who have extensive hands-on experience with AWS and) Tj
T*
(have a deeper understanding of AWS services and best practices.) Tj
T*
(There are two different AWS Professional certifications:) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
