T*
(to identify areas where you need to improve before retaking the exam. It's important to note) Tj
T*
(that earning a CCNP Security certification requires passing multiple exams, so if you fail) Tj
T*
(one exam, it may delay your progress towards earning the certification. Be sure to take) Tj
T*
(advantage of the resources available to help you prepare for the exam, such as study) Tj
