T*
(Program. This program allows you to earn Continuing Education Credits \(CECs\) through a) Tj
T*
(variety of activities, such as attending Cisco Live events, completing online training) Tj
T*
(courses, or participating in Cisco Learning Network study groups. You can earn enough CECs) Tj
T*
(to recertify your CCNP Security certification for an additional three years. It's important) Tj
T*
(to note that you must recertify before your certification expires to avoid a gap in your) Tj
T*
(certification status. If your certification expires, you will need to start the) Tj
T*
(certification process from the beginning and meet all current certification requirements. Be) Tj
T*
(sure to review the recertification options and requirements on the Cisco website to ensure) Tj
T*
(that you stay up to date with the latest recertification policy.) Tj
T*
(19. How can I maintain my CCNP Security certification?) Tj
T*
(? To maintain your CCNP Security certification, you must recertify every three years. There) Tj
T*
(are several ways to recertify your certification, including passing any 300-level Cisco) Tj
T*
(professional-level or Cisco specialist exam \(excluding Sales Specialist exams\), or passing a) Tj
T*
(current CCIE written exam. You can also recertify by passing any Cisco professional-level) Tj
T*
(concentration exam or passing the Cisco Certified Architect \(CCAr\) interview and board) Tj
T*
(review.) Tj
T*
(? In addition to exam-based recertification, you can also recertify through the Cisco) Tj
T*
(Continuing Education Program. This program allows you to earn Continuing Education Credits) Tj
T*
(\(CECs\) through a variety of activities, such as attending Cisco Live events, completing) Tj
T*
(online training courses, or participating in Cisco Learning Network study groups. You can) Tj
T*
(earn enough CECs to recertify your CCNP Security certification for an additional three) Tj
T*
(years.) Tj
T*
(? It's important to note that you must recertify before your certification expires to) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
