(3. How long does the CCNP Collaboration certification training program take to complete?) Tj
T*
(· The duration of the CCNP Collaboration certification training program varies depending on) Tj
T*
(the candidate's prior experience and level of expertise. The program consists of several) Tj
T*
(courses and exams, which can take anywhere from a few months to a year or more to complete.) Tj
T*
(· The program typically involves extensive hands-on training and requires candidates to) Tj
T*
(demonstrate their proficiency in designing, deploying, and troubleshooting Cisco) Tj
T*
(collaboration and unified communication solutions. It is recommended that candidates have at) Tj
T*
(least three to five years of experience in networking, with a focus on collaboration and) Tj
T*
(unified communication solutions, before pursuing the CCNP Collaboration certification.) Tj
T*
(· To earn the CCNP Collaboration certification, candidates must pass four exams:) Tj
T*
(Implementing Cisco Collaboration Core Technologies \(CLCOR 350-801\), Implementing Cisco) Tj
T*
(Collaboration Applications \(CLICA 300-810\), Implementing Cisco Advanced Call Control and) Tj
T*
(Mobility Services \(CLACCM 300-815\), and Implementing Cisco Collaboration Cloud and Edge) Tj
T*
(Solutions \(CLCEI 300-820\).) Tj
T*
(· Overall, the CCNP Collaboration certification training program is rigorous and requires a) Tj
T*
(significant commitment of time and effort. However, it is an excellent program for IT) Tj
T*
(professionals seeking to enhance their skills and expertise in Cisco collaboration and) Tj
T*
(unified communications solutions and to advance their careers in this field.) Tj
T*
