(5.8 HTTPS decryption and inspection on Cisco FTD, WSA and Umbrella) Tj
T*
(5.9 SMA for centralized content security management) Tj
T*
(5.10 Cisco advanced threat solutions and their integration: Stealthwatch, FMC, AMP,) Tj
T*
(Cognitive Threat Analytics \(CTA\), Threat Grid, Encrypted Traffic Analytics \(ETA\), WSA, SMA,) Tj
T*
(CTR, and Umbrella) Tj
T*
(FAQ) Tj
T*
(1. What are the benefits of CCIE Security Certification for my career?) Tj
T*
(The CCIE Security Certification is a highly respected certification in the field of network) Tj
T*
(security. It demonstrates an individual's knowledge and skills in designing, implementing,) Tj
T*
(and managing security solutions using Cisco technologies. Having this certification can) Tj
T*
(enhance your credibility and visibility in the industry, and may lead to better job) Tj
T*
(opportunities, higher salaries, and career growth.) Tj
T*
(2. What skills and knowledge will I gain from the CCIE Security Certification Training) Tj
T*
(program?) Tj
T*
(The CCIE Security Certification Training program covers a wide range of topics related to) Tj
T*
(network security, including network infrastructure security, threat and vulnerability) Tj
T*
(management, identity management, and secure network access. The training program is designed) Tj
T*
