(CCIE Data Center \(v3.0\) Exam Topics ? Practical Exam) Tj
T*
(Exam Description:) Tj
T*
(The Cisco CCIE Data Center \(v3.0\) Practical Exam is an eight-hour, hands-on exam that) Tj
T*
(requires a candidate to plan, design, deploy, operate, and optimize complex Data Center) Tj
T*
(networks.) Tj
T*
(1. Data Center L2/L3 Connectivity \(20%\)) Tj
T*
(1.1 Layer 2 technologies) Tj
T*
(1.2 Routing Protocols and features) Tj
T*
(1.3 Multicast protocols) Tj
T*
