T*
(2.1 Physical fabric components) Tj
T*
(2.2 Fabric policies) Tj
T*
(2.3 Tenant Policies) Tj
T*
(2.4 Fabric Monitoring) Tj
T*
(2.5 Virtual Networking) Tj
T*
(3. Data Center Fabric Connectivity \(15%\)) Tj
T*
(3.1 VRF lite) Tj
T*
(3.2 L3Out) Tj
T*
(3.3 Inter Fabric connectivity) Tj
T*
(3.4 Overlays) Tj
T*
(4. Data Center Compute \(15%\)) Tj
T*
(4.1 Compute Resources) Tj
T*
(4.2 Compute Connectivity) Tj
T*
(5. Data Center Storage Protocols and Features \(10%\)) Tj
T*
(5.1 FC and FCoE) Tj
T*
(5.2 iSCSI) Tj
T*
(5.3 RoCE v2 over IP Networks) Tj
T*
(6. Data Center Security and Network Services \(10%\)) Tj
T*
(6.1 Security features) Tj
T*
(6.2 RBAC) Tj
T*
(6.3 Network Services Insertion and Redirection) Tj
T*
(6.4 Services) Tj
T*
(6.5 Traffic management) Tj
T*
