T*
(7.1 Data center tasks using scripts \(Python and Ansible\)) Tj
T*
(7.2 Data Center Automation and Orchestration using tools) Tj
T*
(FAQ) Tj
T*
(1. What is CCIE Data Center Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(CCIE Data Center Certification Training is a comprehensive training program designed to) Tj
T*
(prepare individuals to become experts in data center networking technologies. The training) Tj
T*
(covers topics such as data center architecture, infrastructure, storage networking, and) Tj
T*
(automation. The program aims to equip individuals with the knowledge and skills required to) Tj
T*
