T*
(Exam Description:) Tj
T*
(Implementing Cisco SD-WAN Solutions v1.0 \(ENSDWI 300-415\) is a 90-minute exam associated) Tj
T*
(with the CCNP Enterprise Certification. This exam certifies a candidate's knowledge of) Tj
T*
(Cisco?s SD-WAN solution including SD-WAN architecture, controller deployment, edge router) Tj
T*
(deployment, policies, security, quality or service, multicast and management and operations.) Tj
T*
(The course, Implementing Cisco SD-WAN Solutions, helps candidates to prepare for this exam.) Tj
T*
(20% 1.0 Architecture) Tj
T*
(1.1 Describe Cisco SD-WAN Architecture and Components) Tj
T*
(1.2 Describe WAN Edge platform types, capabilities \(vEdges, cEdges\)) Tj
T*
