T*
(2.1 Describe controller cloud deployment) Tj
T*
(2.2 Describe Controller on-Prem Deployment) Tj
T*
(2.3 Configure and verify certificates and whitelisting) Tj
T*
(2.4 Troubleshoot control-plane connectivity between controllers) Tj
T*
(20% 3.0 Router Deployment) Tj
T*
