(Implementing Cisco Application Centric Infrastructure v1.0 \(300-620\)) Tj
T*
(Exam Description:) Tj
T*
(Implementing Cisco Application Centric Infrastructure v1.0 \(DCACI 300-620\) is a 90- minute) Tj
T*
(exam that is associated with the CCNP Data Center Certification. This exam tests a) Tj
T*
(candidate's knowledge of Cisco switches in ACI mode including configuration, implementation,) Tj
T*
(and management.) Tj
T*
(20% 1.0 ACI Fabric Infrastructure) Tj
T*
(1.1 Describe ACI topology and hardware) Tj
T*
(1.2 Describe ACI Object Model) Tj
T*
(1.3 Utilize faults, event record, and audit log) Tj
T*
(1.4 Describe ACI fabric discovery) Tj
T*
(1.5 Implement ACI policies) Tj
T*
(1.6 Implement ACI logical constructs) Tj
T*
(15% 2.0 ACI Packet Forwarding) Tj
T*
(2.1 Describe endpoint learning) Tj
T*
(2.2 Implement bridge domain configuration knob \(unicast routing, Layer 2 unknown hardware) Tj
T*
(proxy, ARP flooding\)) Tj
T*
(20% 3.0 External Network Connectivity) Tj
T*
(3.1 Implement Layer 2 out \(STP/MCP basics\)) Tj
T*
(3.2 Implement Layer 3 out \(excludes transit routing and VRF route leaking\)) Tj
T*
(15% 4.0 Integrations) Tj
T*
(4.1 Implement VMware vCenter DVS integration) Tj
T*
(4.2 Describe resolution immediacy in VMM) Tj
T*
(4.3 Implement service graph \(managed and unmanaged\)) Tj
T*
(20% 5.0 ACI Management) Tj
T*
(5.1 Implement out-of-band and in-band) Tj
T*
(5.2 Utilize syslog and snmp services) Tj
T*
(5.3 Implement configuration backup \(snapshot/config import export\)) Tj
T*
