/F1 10 Tf
42 760 Td
14 TL
(The Cisco ACI Certification exam is a 90-minute test consisting of 60-70 multiple-choice and) Tj
T*
(simulation questions.) Tj
T*
(11. What kind of job roles can I get after completing Cisco ACI Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(After completing the Cisco ACI Certification Training, you can apply for job roles such as) Tj
T*
(Network Engineer, Network Administrator, Network Consultant, and Data Center Engineer.) Tj
T*
(12. Is there any post-course support or resources available to help me prepare for the exam?) Tj
T*
(Yes, we provide online resources and study materials to help you prepare for the Cisco ACI) Tj
T*
(Certification exam. Additionally, some training providers offer exam preparation courses.) Tj
T*
(13. How long is the Cisco ACI Certification valid for?) Tj
T*
(The Cisco ACI Certification is valid for three years. we provide online resources and study) Tj
T*
(materials to help you prepare for the Cisco ACI Certification exam. Additionally, some) Tj
T*
(training providers offer exam preparation courses.) Tj
T*
(14. Can I recertify my Cisco ACI Certification?) Tj
T*
(Yes, you can recertify your Cisco ACI Certification by passing a relevant exam or earning) Tj
T*
(Continuing Education credits.) Tj
T*
(15. What is the process for recertification?) Tj
T*
(To recertify your Cisco ACI Certification, you can take and pass a relevant exam, such as a) Tj
T*
(higher-level certification exam or a technology-focused exam. Alternatively, you can earn) Tj
T*
(Continuing Education credits by attending Cisco-approved training or events.) Tj
T*
