14 TL
(. You'll learn about the benefits of network virtualization, how to configure VXLAN and) Tj
T*
(EVPN, and how to troubleshoot common issues.) Tj
T*
(Our course is perfect for anyone who wants to improve their networking skills. Whether) Tj
T*
(you're an experienced network engineer or a beginner, our course will provide you with the) Tj
T*
(knowledge and skills you need to succeed.) Tj
T*
(What makes our course unique is our focus on practical, hands-on learning. We provide you) Tj
T*
(with real-world scenarios and exercises so you can apply what you learn in the classroom to) Tj
T*
(real-world situations.) Tj
T*
(Don't miss out on this opportunity to learn about the future of network virtualization. Sign) Tj
T*
(up for our VXLAN-EVPN Course today and take your networking skills to the next level!) Tj
T*
(VXLAN \(Virtual Extensible LAN\) and EVPN \(Ethernet VPN\)) Tj
T*
(are two of the most popular technologies used in network virtualization. VXLAN is a) Tj
T*
(tunnelling protocol used to create virtual networks over an existing physical network, while) Tj
T*
(EVPN is a mechanism used to extend layer 2 and layer 3 connectivity between different) Tj
T*
(locations.) Tj
T*
(Here's a breakdown of the key concepts you'll learn about in our VXLAN-EVPN course:) Tj
T*
(Network Virtualization) Tj
T*
(: You'll learn about the benefits of network virtualization, including improved scalability,) Tj
T*
(flexibility, and agility.) Tj
T*
(VXLAN) Tj
T*
(: You'll learn about VXLAN technology and how it works, including) Tj
T*
(VXLAN packet format, VXLAN VTEPs \(VXLAN Tunnel Endpoints\), and VXLAN configuration) Tj
T*
(.) Tj
T*
(EVPN) Tj
T*
(Cisco: You'll learn about EVPN technology and how it can be used to extend layer 2 and layer) Tj
T*
(3 connectivity between different locations. You'll also learn about EVPN types, MAC) Tj
T*
(learning, and ARP suppression.) Tj
T*
(VXLAN-EVPN Integration) Tj
T*
(: You'll learn about how VXLAN and EVPN can be integrated together to provide a complete) Tj
T*
(network virtualization solution. You'll learn about different deployment scenarios,) Tj
T*
(including spine-leaf architecture and VXLAN-EVPN with BGP.) Tj
T*
(Troubleshooting) Tj
T*
(: You'll learn how to troubleshoot common issues that may arise when working with VXLAN and) Tj
T*
(EVPN, including) Tj
T*
(VTEP connectivity issues, routing issues, and multicast issues) Tj
T*
(.) Tj
T*
(Our) Tj
T*
(VXLAN-EVPN course) Tj
T*
(is designed to provide you with a comprehensive understanding of these technologies, as well) Tj
T*
(as practical skills that you can use in real-world situations. By the end of the course,) Tj
T*
(you'll be able to confidently design, deploy, and) Tj
T*
(troubleshoot VXLAN-EVPN networks) Tj
T*
(.) Tj
T*
(Download VXLAN-EVPN Content) Tj
T*
