(FAQ) Tj
T*
(1. What is Cisco ISE Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(Cisco ISE \(Identity Services Engine\) Certification Training is a program that provides) Tj
T*
(learners with the knowledge and skills required to design, implement, configure, and support) Tj
T*
(Cisco ISE solutions. Cisco ISE is a network access control and policy enforcement platform) Tj
T*
(that allows organizations to secure their networks by controlling user and device access.) Tj
T*
(2. What are the benefits of getting Cisco ISE certification?) Tj
T*
(Cisco ISE certification demonstrates that a professional has the knowledge and skills) Tj
T*
(required to design, implement, configure, and support Cisco ISE solutions. The certification) Tj
T*
(can help professionals enhance their career opportunities, increase their earning potential,) Tj
T*
(and gain recognition in the industry.) Tj
T*
(3. How long is the Cisco ISE training?) Tj
T*
(The duration of the Cisco ISE training program Is 40-50 Hours.) Tj
T*
(4. What is the mode of Cisco ISE training - online or offline?) Tj
T*
(The mode of Cisco ISE training combines both online and in-person learning.) Tj
T*
(5. What are the prerequisites for the Cisco ISE course?) Tj
T*
(The prerequisites for the Cisco ISE course participants are expected to have basic knowledge) Tj
T*
