(includes practical lab exercises that allow you to apply your knowledge and gain hands-on) Tj
T*
(experience with Cisco routers and BGP configurations. This practical approach helps you) Tj
T*
(develop the necessary skills to configure, troubleshoot, and optimize BGP networks) Tj
T*
(effectively.) Tj
