(Exam Preparation: Prepare for the certification exam by studying the course materials,) Tj
T*
(practice exams, and participating in review sessions.) Tj
T*
(Certification Exam: Schedule and take the Microsoft certification exam. The exam tests your) Tj
T*
(knowledge and skills in specific Microsoft technologies and frameworks.) Tj
T*
(Certification Achievement: Upon successfully passing the exam, you will receive the official) Tj
T*
(Microsoft certification, validating your proficiency in the respective technology.) Tj
T*
