T*
(Q: What are the different VMware certification tracks available?) Tj
T*
(A: VMware offers a comprehensive range of certification tracks to cater to various areas of) Tj
T*
(expertise. The main certification tracks include:) Tj
T*
(Data Center Virtualization: Focuses on VMware vSphere and data center virtualization) Tj
T*
(technologies.) Tj
T*
(Network Virtualization: Focuses on VMware NSX and network virtualization.) Tj
T*
(Cloud Management and Automation: Focuses on VMware vRealize Suite and cloud management and) Tj
T*
(automation technologies.) Tj
T*
(Desktop and Mobility: Focuses on VMware Horizon and virtual desktop infrastructure \(VDI\)) Tj
T*
(technologies.) Tj
T*
(Digital Workspace: Focuses on VMware Workspace ONE and digital workspace solutions.) Tj
T*
(Q: How does VMware certification benefit IT professionals?) Tj
T*
