(Q: How does cloud certification differ from traditional IT certifications?) Tj
T*
(A: Cloud certifications focus specifically on cloud computing technologies, platforms, and) Tj
T*
(services offered by different vendors. They validate your expertise in utilizing and) Tj
T*
(managing cloud resources effectively. Traditional IT certifications, on the other hand,) Tj
