T*
(2. What are the benefits of getting AWS Professional?) Tj
T*
(Getting an AWS Professional certification can be beneficial for your career in cloud) Tj
T*
(computing. It can help you gain advanced knowledge and skills in AWS services and make you) Tj
T*
(eligible for job roles such as AWS Cloud Architect, AWS DevOps Engineer, and AWS Security) Tj
T*
(Specialist. It can also improve your chances of getting a higher salary and job) Tj
T*
(opportunities in the cloud computing industry.) Tj
T*
(3. How long is the AWS Professional training program?) Tj
T*
(The duration of the AWS Professional training program may vary depending on the training) Tj
T*
(provider. Typically, it takes around 40-50 Hours to complete the course.) Tj
T*
(4. What is the mode of AWS Professional training - online or offline?) Tj
T*
(AWS Professional training programs are available both online and offline. Online training) Tj
T*
(allows students to learn at their own pace and from anywhere with an internet connection,) Tj
T*
(while offline training provides a more traditional classroom experience.) Tj
T*
(5. What are the prerequisites for the AWS Professional course?) Tj
T*
(To Enroll in the AWS Professional course, you must have a solid understanding of AWS) Tj
T*
(fundamentals. You should also have experience in cloud architecture, security, and) Tj
T*
(deployment.) Tj
T*
(6. What is the fee structure and are there any discounts available?) Tj
T*
(The fee structure for the AWS Professional course can vary depending on the in which time) Tj
T*
(you Enroll in this course. Discounts may be available for early registration, group) Tj
T*
(registration, or for certain categories of learners, such as students or veterans.) Tj
T*
(7.What are the job opportunities after completing the AWS Professional training?) Tj
T*
(Completing the AWS Professional training can open up various job opportunities such as AWS) Tj
T*
(Cloud Architect, AWS DevOps Engineer, and AWS Security Specialist. These job roles are in) Tj
T*
(high demand and offer attractive salaries and benefits.) Tj
T*
(8. How can I enroll for AWS Professional in Online?) Tj
T*
(Individuals can Enroll for the AWS Professional training program in Online by you can go Net) Tj
T*
(Expert Solutions Website \(www.nexpertsolutions.com\) as well as NES Physical Center) Tj
T*
(9. How do I register for the AWS Professional certification exam?) Tj
T*
(To register for the AWS Professional certification exam, you need to create an account on) Tj
T*
(the AWS Certification Portal and schedule the exam. You will need to pay the exam fee and) Tj
T*
(choose a testing center to take the exam. It's recommended to prepare well for the exam and) Tj
T*
(take practice tests before scheduling the exam.) Tj
