(FAQ) Tj
T*
(1.What is Azure AZ-104 Certification Training?) Tj
T*
(Azure AZ-104 Certification Training is a training program that provides comprehensive) Tj
T*
(knowledge and skills in Microsoft Azure cloud services. The program covers various topics) Tj
T*
(such as Azure administration, security, networking, and storage. It is designed for) Tj
T*
(individuals who want to become proficient in managing and deploying Azure services.) Tj
T*
(2.What are the benefits of getting Azure AZ-104?) Tj
T*
(Getting Azure AZ-104 certified can be beneficial for your career in cloud computing. It can) Tj
T*
(help you gain in-depth knowledge and skills in Azure cloud services and make you eligible) Tj
T*
(for job roles such as Azure Administrator, Cloud Solutions Architect, and Cloud Security) Tj
T*
(Engineer. It can also improve your chances of getting a higher salary and job opportunities) Tj
T*
(in the cloud computing industry.) Tj
T*
(3.How long is the Azure AZ-104 training program?) Tj
T*
(The duration of the Azure AZ-104 training program may vary depending on the training) Tj
T*
(provider. Typically, it takes around 40-50 Hours to complete the course.) Tj
T*
(4.What is the mode of Azure AZ-104 training - online or offline?) Tj
T*
(The mode of Azure AZ-104 training is available both online and offline. Online training) Tj
T*
(allows students to learn at their own pace and from anywhere with an internet connection,) Tj
T*
(while offline training provides a more traditional classroom experience.) Tj
T*
(5.What are the prerequisites for the Azure AZ-104 course?) Tj
T*
(To enroll in the Azure AZ-104 course, you must have a basic understanding of Networking and) Tj
T*
(Cloud.) Tj
T*
(6.What is the fee structure and are there any discounts available?) Tj
T*
(The fee structure for the Azure AZ-104 course can vary depending on the in which time you) Tj
T*
(Enroll in this course. Discounts may be available for early registration, group) Tj
T*
(registration, or for certain categories of learners, such as students or veterans.) Tj
T*
(7.What are the job opportunities after completing the Azure AZ-104 training?) Tj
T*
(Completing the Azure AZ-104 training can open various job opportunities such as Azure) Tj
T*
(Administrator, Cloud Solutions Architect, and Cloud Security Engineer. These job roles are) Tj
T*
(in high demand and offer attractive salaries and benefits.) Tj
T*
(8.How can I enroll for Azure AZ-104 in Noida, Delhi NCR, India?) Tj
T*
(Individuals can Enroll for the Azure AZ-104 training program in Noida, Delhi NCR, India by) Tj
T*
(you can go Net Expert Solutions Website \(www.nexpertsolutions.com\) as well as NES Physical) Tj
T*
(Center) Tj
T*
(9.How do I register for the Azure AZ-104 certification exam?) Tj
T*
(To register for the Azure AZ-104 certification exam, you need to create an account on the) Tj
T*
(Microsoft Certification Portal and schedule the exam. You will need to pay the exam fee and) Tj
T*
(choose a testing center to take the exam. It's recommended to prepare well for the exam and) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
