stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
42 760 Td
14 TL
(Cisco Certified Network Associate \(CCNA\) is an entry-level certification that is highly) Tj
T*
(valued in the networking industry. In this module, you will learn about the fundamentals of) Tj
T*
(networking, including LAN and WAN technologies, routing protocols, and network security.) Tj
T*
(CCNP:) Tj
T*
(The Cisco Certified Network Professional \(CCNP\) certification is a more advanced) Tj
T*
(certification that builds on the concepts covered in the CCNA module. In this module, you) Tj
T*
(will learn about advanced networking concepts, including BGP, MPLS, and QoS.) Tj
T*
(AWS:) Tj
T*
(Amazon Web Services \(AWS\) is a popular cloud computing platform that is widely used by) Tj
T*
(businesses of all sizes. In this module, you will learn about the AWS platform, including) Tj
T*
(EC2, S3, and RDS.) Tj
T*
